{
"markdown": "### Crane\n\nA powerful management solution that lets you create and use multiple separate data profiles (multiple accounts) for the same app.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Crane/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Crane/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Crane/Screenshots/3.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Crane/Screenshots/4.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 4"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Fast account switching:** Easily switch back and forth between containers (e.g. main account, alt account) instantly. Supports most apps.\n- **Independent data (Sandboxing):** Crane redirects data to different paths. One container's data is completely separate from another's.\n- **Separate Keychain:** Each container has its own keychain group, ensuring login credentials never conflict.\n- **Haptic Touch integration:** Quickly switch containers right from the Home Screen by pressing and holding the app icon (Haptic Touch menu).\n- **Notification support:**\n  - Receive push notifications from all containers at the same time.\n  - Clearly shows which container a notification comes from.\n  - The badge (notification count on the icon) is the sum of all containers.\n- **Backup & Restore:** Integrated container data backup manager in the Files app, making it easy to store and restore.\n- **Game Center & Apple ID support:** Optionally separate Game Center and Apple ID accounts for each container (extremely useful for gamers farming multiple accounts).",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
